g.text:
[Diagnostics] Only phone number and PIN entered; no DeviceId credential provided;
[Root Cause] Carrier security mechanisms require authorized device hardware binding;
[Resolution] Launch local auth tool, complete slider + SMS verification, inject DeviceId into HA entry;
[Verification] HA logs report resultCode=0000; entities switch from unavailable to real balances.

[Diagnostics] Puzzle piece visually matches the slot, but API repeatedly returns 'Captcha Error';
[Root Cause] Puzzle PNG contains transparent alpha padding; raw naturalWidth creates severe origin offset;
[Resolution] Use offscreen Canvas to scan alpha channel and extract bounding box (opaqueBounds);
[Verification] Calculated travel and nativeLeft match the slot pixel-for-pixel; passes on first drag.

[Diagnostics] First number works, but adding second number or restarting HA crashes one entry;
[Root Cause] Concurrent entries call register_static_path simultaneously, causing routing conflicts;
[Resolution] Introduce module-level asyncio.Lock(); acquire lock and set registration flag;
[Verification] Both entries show 'Loaded' state; 18 sensors loaded cleanly per phone number.

[Diagnostics] Attempting silent gateway auto-login via open.e.189.cn on home broadband WiFi;
[Root Cause] Carrier gateway auth relies on 4G/5G cell towers directly probing SIM crypto hardware;
[Resolution] Abandon cellular gateway path; utilize standard official SMS challenge handshake;
[Verification] Carrier triggers SMS code; returns signed, compliant DeviceId credential.
